<p>Grab a target and drag it to your side, holding it in place and silencing non-undead and creatures that need to breathe for 5 turns.</p><p>The grab will also deal <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">41, 55, 66, 75, 83</acronym> slime damage per turn.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Mindpower.</p>